WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.597
No source code. Where do you even start?

00:00:02.817 --> 00:00:06.114
This viral GitHub tool lets an AI agent inspect software.

00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:08.895
But the trick is evidence. Change one input.

00:00:09.734 --> 00:00:12.025
See which bytes change. Write a theory.

00:00:13.134 --> 00:00:15.305
Then test a file you haven't checked yet.

00:00:16.534 --> 00:00:19.901
That's reverse engineering. Not magic source code recovery.

00:00:20.121 --> 00:00:26.359
The full guide and free lab are in AI Got Weird on Telegram. Search ship AI brief. Open post eighty-one.
